# OpenRouter models permitted for this experiment.
# Checked 2026-10-04: the pinned rows had prompt and completion price "0",
# and advertised tools plus structured_outputs or response_format.
# Do not add typesafe/jev-router (dynamic price).
#
# openrouter/free is the seed mixer only. It picks a free model at random,
# already filtered to ones that can call tools. Do not use it for evals:
# a score needs a pinned id, the two rows below.
openrouter/free
qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free
nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free

# Paid, for evals. Released 2026-09-22. Checked 2026-10-05: $0.10 in /
# $0.50 out per 1M tokens, cached input $0.01, tools and reasoning on
# every host. Pin OPENROUTER_PROVIDER=OpenAI with it so a score is about
# one deployment. About $1 per 5M in + 1M out, before caching.
openai/gpt-6-luna

# Direct from OpenAI (OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1).
# Checked 2026-10-05 on developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing, per 1M:
# $0.10 in / $0.01 cached / $0.50 out; flex tier is half that.
gpt-6-luna
